  <!--EN: The {PAWN_title} known as {PAWN_nameDef} has emerged from a rusty cryptosleep casket, wearing nothing but a thin patient gown. They immediately join your colony.\n\n{PAWN_nameFull} is known as an ideal patient. Their body accepts every archite injection without risk of rejection, as though their cells were made to adapt to genetic change. This makes them uniquely suited for experiments with advanced archite technology - in fact, they have already undergone a few experiments before, as they carry several archite genes.\n\n{PAWN_labelShort} also suffers from a rare illness called Hemocollapse Syndrome. Their blood slowly fails over time, leaving them weaker as the days pass. Care and treatment can slow the disease, but it cannot be cured, and in the end, it will take their life.-->
  <VQEA_ExperimentJoinsLetterDescription>被称为{PAWN_nameDef}的{PAWN_title}从生锈的隐睡棺材中出现，只穿着一件薄薄的病号服。他们立即加入您的群体。

{PAWN_nameFull} 被称为理想患者。他们的身体接受每一次 Archite 注射，没有排斥的风险，就好像他们的细胞是为了适应基因变化而生的。这使得它们特别适合使用先进的 archite 技术进行实验 - 事实上，它们之前已经进行过一些实验，因为它们携带多个 archite 基因。

{PAWN_labelShort} 还患有一种称为血液塌陷综合症的罕见疾病。随着时间的推移，他们的血液慢慢衰竭，让他们随着时间的推移变得越来越虚弱。护理和治疗可以减缓病情，但无法治愈，最终会夺去他们的生命。</VQEA_ExperimentJoinsLetterDescription>
  <!--EN: Experiment joins: {PAWN_nameDef}-->
  <VQEA_ExperimentJoinsLetterLabel>实验加入：{PAWN_nameDef}</VQEA_ExperimentJoinsLetterLabel>
