  <VQEA_InfusionComaDuration>输液昏迷时间</VQEA_InfusionComaDuration>
  <!--EN: Inject-->
  <VQEA_Inject>注入</VQEA_Inject>
  <!--EN: Insert person-->
  <VQEA_InsertPerson>插入人</VQEA_InsertPerson>
  <!--EN: Insert a person into the archogen injector. Their genetic material will be injected with chaotic archites, which will cause random genetic mutations with a chance to form an archite gene, but also random other xenogenes.\n\nArchite injection is a painful process and will force the subject into a temporary coma while the organism adapts to the new genetic composition.-->
  <VQEA_InsertPersonDesc>将人插入原源注射器中。他们的遗传物质将被注入混乱的 archite，这将导致随机基因突变，有机会形成 archite 基因，但也会随机产生其他异种基因。

Archite 注射是一个痛苦的过程，将迫使受试者进入暂时昏迷状态，同时有机体适应新的基因组成。</VQEA_InsertPersonDesc>
  <!--EN: Insert the person into the ancient wonderdoc. They will then undergo the selected procedure, but with a risk of malfunction occurring.-->
  <VQEA_InsertPersonIntoWonderdocDesc>将人插入古代的 Wonderdoc 中。然后他们将接受选定的程序，但存在发生故障的风险。</VQEA_InsertPersonIntoWonderdocDesc>
