  <!--EN: Intercept the broadcast to find out the location of another lab where the broadcast is directed.-->
  <VQEA_InterceptBroadcastDesc>拦截广播以找出广播定向的另一个实验室的位置。</VQEA_InterceptBroadcastDesc>
  <!--EN: Launch capsule-->
