  <!--EN: The archite injection has caused a mutation!\n\n{PAWN_nameDef} has been injected with volatile archites, but {PAWN_possessive} body reacted badly to the forced evolution, turning {PAWN_objective} into a mutant.\n\n{PAWN_pronoun} have emerged from the archogen injector and will destroy all the lab equipment {PAWN_pronoun} can find in the blind, animalistic rage.\n\nYou can try and stop {PAWN_objective}, or let {PAWN_objective} leave.-->
  <VQEA_LetterDesc_Mutation>弓石注射引起了突变！

{PAWN_nameDef}被注射了挥发性弓石，但{PAWN_possessive}身体对强制进化反应很差，将{PAWN_objective}变成了突变体。

{PAWN_pronoun}已从原源注射器中出现，并将摧毁{PAWN_pronoun}可以在盲中找到的所有实验室设备，动物性的愤怒。

你可以尝试停止{PAWN_objective}，或者让{PAWN_objective}离开。</VQEA_LetterDesc_Mutation>
  <!--EN: The archite injection has been rejected.\n\n{PAWN_nameDef} has been injected with volatile archites, but {PAWN_possessive} body rejected the alterations to the genetic composition.\n\n{PAWN_pronoun} will now enter an injection coma while {PAWN_possessive} body recovers.-->
  <VQEA_LetterDesc_Rejection>Archite 注射已被拒绝。

{PAWN_nameDef} 已注射挥发性 Archite，但 {PAWN_possessive} 身体拒绝了对遗传组成的改变。

{PAWN_pronoun} 现在将进入注射昏迷状态，同时 {PAWN_possessive} 身体恢复。</VQEA_LetterDesc_Rejection>
  <!--EN: The archite injection has been successful.\n\n{PAWN_nameDef} has been injected with volatile archites and has gained a new archite gene: {ARCHITEGENE_label}.\n\nAs a side effect, {PAWN_nameDef} has also developed an additional gene: {SIDEEFFECTGENE_label}.\n\n{PAWN_pronoun} will now enter an injection coma while {PAWN_possessive} body adapts to the new genetic composition.-->
  <VQEA_LetterDesc_Success>archite 注射已成功。

{PAWN_nameDef} 已注射挥发性 archite，并获得了新的 archite 基因：{ARCHITEGENE_label}。

作为副作用，{PAWN_nameDef} 还开发了一个额外的基因： {SIDEEFFECTGENE_label}.

{PAWN_pronoun} 现在将进入注射昏迷状态，同时 {PAWN_possessive} 身体适应新的基因组成。</VQEA_LetterDesc_Success>
  <!--EN: The archite injection has been successful.\n\n{PAWN_nameDef} has been injected with volatile archites and has gained a new archite gene: {ARCHITEGENE_label}.\n\n{PAWN_pronoun} will now enter an injection coma while {PAWN_possessive} body adapts to the new genetic composition.-->
  <VQEA_LetterDesc_SuccessNoSideEffect>archite注射已成功。

{PAWN_nameDef}已注射挥发性archite，并获得了新的archite基因：{ARCHITEGENE_label}。

{PAWN_pronoun}现在将进入注射昏迷状态，同时{PAWN_possessive}身体适应新的基因成分。</VQEA_LetterDesc_SuccessNoSideEffect>
